    covers: "35 new in xtask/src/doc.rs (59 -> 94) for the twelve Tier-1 predicates, the design-surface pragma, the vocabulary bridge, the closed-run guard and four review fixes; 28 in the new ui/eslint-rules/vocabulary.test.js (RuleTester, every judgement the design/vocabulary rule makes); 1 in MethodLabel.test.tsx for the reverted verb tones. Recomputed by measurement at this tip, not carried forward - an earlier revision of this note stated a total its own breakdown did not sum to, which review caught"
