    waived: "the flow e2e is W7's deliverable per the epic plan - W6 ships the rulebook and its two checkers, and there is no user-facing flow to drive. The nearest whole-system checks that do exist were run: cargo xtask ui specimens --check renders all six migrated design files over file://, and node eslint-rules/reconcile.mjs diffs the rule's class enumeration against the built stylesheet"
gates:
  - "cargo test --workspace: 307 passed, 0 failed"
  - "cargo fmt --check / cargo clippy -D warnings (pedantic, workspace, all targets): clean"
  - "npx vitest run: 476 passed across 39 files"
  - "npx eslint src eslint-rules: exit 0 - design/vocabulary green over all of ui/src/ (142 violations across 58 classes at the WU's start)"
  - "npx tsc -b: exit 0"
  - "cargo xtask ui specimens --check: all six migrated design files render"
